9,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":2454550538,"text":"えっと…ここのはずなのに…","nextNodeIds":[220260102]},{"nodeId":220260102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2397533970,"text":"ジュリー？どうしてここに？","nextNodeIds":[220260103]},{"nodeId":220260103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":3548577562,"text":"あれ？旅人じゃない。へへっ、ここで会えるなんて…","nextNodeIds":[220260104]},{"nodeId":220260104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":1939312994,"text":"旭東が新しい料理の研究を始めたから、私は食材を探しに来たの。パルヴァネもアイデアを出してくれてるの。","nextNodeIds":[220260105]},{"nodeId":220260105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":82682842,"text":"旭東は稲妻の「三色団子」を参考にして、甘いフワフワの料理を作ろうとしているの。そのために特別な食材が何種類も必要なんだって。","nextNodeIds":[220260106]},{"nodeId":220260106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":4062499474,"text":"宗久のおじさんは町でスミレウリを買いに、私はここで「緋櫻毬」を集めてたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[220260107]},{"nodeId":220260107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":2315772018,"text":"ある程度集めたんだけど、まだ少し足りないの。もっと奥に行って探したかったんだけど、魔物がたくさんいて…","nextNodeIds":[220260108]},{"nodeId":220260108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":753948706,"text":"だからお願い、旅人！「緋櫻毬」を三つ集めてきてくれる？","nextNodeIds":[220260109,220260111]},{"nodeId":220260109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1646361890,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[220260110]},{"nodeId":220260110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":1132410266,"text":"ありがとう！戻ってきたら、美味しいものを食べさせてあげる！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220260111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1089577666,"text":"魔物くらい倒せるでしょ？","nextNodeIds":[220260112]},{"nodeId":220260112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":3494690746,"text":"まあ、普段はそうなんだけど…","nextNodeIds":[220260113]},{"nodeId":220260113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":1324775986,"text":"でも何というか、もし本当に魔物たちと戦ったら、きっと食材集めのことを忘れちゃうと思うの。","nextNodeIds":[220260114]},{"nodeId":220260114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":684221434,"text":"モンドにいた時もそうだったもの。どんな依頼でも、魔物と戦うとそれに集中し過ぎて、他のことをすべて忘れてしまう。","nextNodeIds":[220260115]},{"nodeId":220260115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":623528418,"text":"魔物を一体も残らず倒して、そこで初めて、まだ依頼が残っていることを思い出すの…そのせいで、たくさんの依頼を失敗しちゃった…","nextNodeIds":[220260116]},{"nodeId":220260116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2161107882,"text":"魔物が嫌いなんだね…","nextNodeIds":[220260117]},{"nodeId":220260117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":2484380378,"text":"魔物が嫌い？それが原因ってわけじゃないよ。実は…魔物と戦う時、すごく楽しいんだ…","nextNodeIds":[220260118]},{"nodeId":220260118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":1148342258,"text":"魔物を倒すこと以外何も考える必要がない。一つのことに没頭する感じを体験したことある？すごく爽快だった。","nextNodeIds":[220260119]},{"nodeId":220260119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":164817426,"text":"ああ、そんなことはいいから。とにかく、「緋櫻毬」の件は任せたよ。","nextNodeIds":[220260120]},{"nodeId":220260120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"ジュリー","textMapHash":4221403810,"text":"戻ってきたら、美味しいものを食べさせてあげる！","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":2202602,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE